     - `lib.rs`: the `ItemReed` branch now also places item 354 as block 92 (solid ground below, the player's box must be clear: `canBlockBePlacedAt`); a tap on a cake heals 3 below full health and adds a bite (meta + 1), the sixth bite removes it.
     - `world/chunk.rs`: `box_bounds` (drawn / outline: loses 2/16 from -X per bite), `CAKE_PHYS` (116..=121, collision 1/16 lower), not `opaque`. `render/atlas.rs`: tiles 121 top, 122 sides, 123 bitten face, 124 bottom. `world/ticks.rs`: ground not solid = gone. `world/items.rs`: drops nothing, stack of 1. `world/craft.rs`: recipe (3 milk, 2 sugar, 3 wheat, egg), and `take_result` now leaves an empty bucket for a water / lava / milk bucket (`getContainerItem`).
     - Not done: sugar has no source until M16 (sugar cane -> sugar recipe), a punch (`onBlockClicked`) does not eat, eat sound.
+- `done` Additive modpack audit (`additive-main.zip` is a packwiz manifest of ~60 Fabric mods, no code; compiled: no, ran: no, written without a toolchain; +1 test `touch_ui::tests::zoom_button_is_a_hold`, not yet to be tested). Ported: Zoomify (`PointerRole::Zoom`, `LayoutRects::zoom`, `TouchUi::zooming`, `lib.rs` `ZOOM` = 4x on the vertical tangent, eased 14/s, look sensitivity scaled by the field of view) and Dynamic FPS (the paused menu sleeps 90 ms a frame in `android_main`; the unfocused case never draws on Android).
+    - Already here: Sodium / Embeddium (`embeddium/`), C2ME (chunk I/O thread, workers), Lithium / Radium (cached collision boxes), Iris + shader packs (the Photon passes), Sodium Extra (fog, clouds, weather in the frame).
+    - Not applicable (no b1.7.3 or Android counterpart): everything about Fabric, Mod Menu, config libraries, networking and servers (Krypton, VMP, ServerCore, e4mc, World Host, fast pings), skins and capes (Ears, Cape Provider), resource-pack features (CIT, OptiGUI, EMF / ETF / ESF, Continuity, Polytone, Puzzle, Skyboxify, Animatica, Language Reload: the assets are baked in), keyboard / macOS fixes, chat reporting, Main Menu Credits (no main menu yet).
+    - Left out on purpose, each with its reason: Lambda Better Grass and Cull Fewer Leaves (the pack ships them off), FastQuit (saving is already a thread), Fast Noise / Fast Surface / Material Rule Compiler (would risk the bit-exact golden tests), ScalableLux (the light engine is not the measured bottleneck), Particle Core / ImmediatelyFast / Better Block Entities (no measurement to aim at), Controlify (gamepad needs a device to check), LambDynamicLights and Entity Culling (real work in the mesher / mob draw, not a one-line port; open if wanted).
